Description: NVIDIA GPU management tool — GUI
 Verde provides a graphical interface for managing NVIDIA GPU drivers,
 monitoring GPU health, detecting power/suspend issues, and applying
 one-click fixes on Ubuntu systems.

Package: verde-daemon
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         python3,
         python3-gi,
         systemd,
         dbus,
         apt,
         polkitd | policykit-1
Description: NVIDIA GPU management daemon
 System daemon for Verde that handles driver installation, power
 management, snapshot/rollback operations, and GPU monitoring via
 D-Bus. Runs as a systemd service with Polkit authorization.
